-- The signing line, its day and month written in by hand: 25 December 2008,
-- the day the corpus dates the agreement by. The primary prints the line
-- with the day and month left blank (its preamble/p3).
@ref akn:preamble/p7
`the day this copy was signed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 25 12 2008

