#ASSERT `a mother's week annexed for the position` `annex ב from age 50` (73.53%) (90%) TRUE EQUALS JUST (`a week of` 16 3 4)
#ASSERT `a mother's week annexed for the position` `annex ב from age 55` (75.00%) (90%) TRUE EQUALS JUST (`a week of` 16 2 4)
